[info] AskCliSpec:
[info] - the item-file index answers get and query exactly like the in-memory fake, reading files only
[info] - fake mode answers one question, writes the audit, answer, records, and a manifest under --out
[info] - usage errors: live needs a profile, and the Haiku rate is at most 8 per minute
[info] LogicSpec:
[info] - pair expansion: 0 and 1 authors give no pairs
[info] - pair expansion: 2 authors give exactly the pair (#1, #2)
[info] - pair expansion: 3 authors give (#1,#2), (#1,#3), (#2,#3)
[info] - pair expansion: 12 authors give 66 distinct canonical pairs; #10 sorts before #2
[info] - pair records carry work ID, year, positions, source provenance, and validate
[info] - a team lists mention IDs in author order and validates
[info] - team-size buckets
[info] - exact keys use core DOI and ORCID normalization
[info] - exact DOI join: non-DBLP works match the single DBLP work; repeats count as duplicates
[info] - exact DOI join: two DBLP works with one DOI are a conflict and nothing merges
[info] - conflict cap: a conflicting group above max-conflict-group-size emits no pairs
[info] - exact DOI join: two OpenAlex works with one DOI conflict; no work per DOI is assumed
[info] - exact DOI join: no DBLP work means unmatched
[info] - exact ORCID join: each mention matches the iD; two slots on one work are a conflict
[info] - orcid suffix conflict (er-v2): Wei Wang 0001 and 0002 under one ORCID never merge
[info] - orcid suffix conflict (er-v1): the same input is unchanged, both mentions match the iD
[info] - orcid suffix conflict (er-v2): the whole group conflicts, all n(n-1)/2 pairs, no match
[info] - orcid suffix conflict (er-v2): one suffixed and one unsuffixed mention still match
[info] DblpParserSpec:
[info] - the DTD defines the character entities, including those used by the sample
[info] - entities resolve to Unicode; numeric references and builtins pass through the XML parser
[info] - an undeclared entity rejects the record as a schema failure
[info] - multiline titles keep their full text and inline markup contributes its text
[info] - Unicode text decoded from ISO-8859-1 bytes is kept
[info] - missing optional fields give None and empty collections, not rejects
[info] - normalizedName and normalizedTitle come from entity-resolution Normalize (norm-v1)
[info] - repeated authors keep separate positions and mention IDs and are counted
[info] - fields map to the work record with provenance; DOI and arXiv come from ee links
[info] - a record without a key is rejected as missing key
[info] - unsupported record types and malformed years are rejected with reasons
[info] - every record of the committed sample parses and validates
[info] HaikuClientSpec:
[info] - the request body is an Anthropic Messages body with temperature and no top_p
[info] - the response parser joins text blocks and reads usage; other bodies are refused
[info] - an expired token is retried once, after the caller's throttle hook
[info] RuntimeRecordsSpec:
[info] - request and planner output round-trip, with absent and present optional fields
[info] - query plan round-trips and enums are their case names on the wire
[info] - an unknown enum value fails decoding
[info] - resolution and every graph-fact record round-trip
[info] - semantic result, bundle, synthesis output, and verification round-trip
[info] - answer and audit record round-trip
[info] - metric attributes cover every core metric, and the ranked ones are the stored rankings
[info] - schema versions are distinct
[info] RenderSpec:
[info] - model versioning and selection constants
[info] - candidates with facts pass the storage candidate validator unchanged
[info] - rendered documents pass RenderedDocuments.validate and follow the key and hash rules
[info] - bad inputs: missing facts, facts that disagree, rank gaps, wrong policy, duplicates
[info] - render CLI writes write-once files and a manifest; a rerun is Unchanged
[info] - render CLI refuses an unknown model and bad candidates without writing
[info] SmokeSpec:
[info] - structural smoke tests pass on the fake store with fake embeddings
[info] - smoke queries use facts only, and a structural filter returns only matching documents
[info] - smoke CLI: dry run passes; live needs --profile; unknown model is a usage error
[info] - semantic context: evidence items, hash check, escaping, budget
[info] BlockingSpec:
[info] - members: one work member and one researcher member per mention, with ER blocking keys
[info] - multi-pass J05 logic equals OversizePolicy.plan, for several maximum block sizes
[info] - max 2 by hand: r0 wang|w (5) and r1 wang|wei (3) re-key; r2 wang|wei|lee (3) is oversize
[info] - group: buffers at most max members, then streams; duplicates are dropped while buffering
[info] - pairs: n members give n(n-1)/2 pairs in ID order; two mentions of one work are skipped
[info] - features and candidates: ER Features applied unchanged; venue names from the side input
[info] - J10 decisions: er-v1 applied unchanged; blocked work pairs add WorkPairFeatures
[info] - J10 decisions: the given version reaches WorkPairFeatures and MatchPolicy (er-v2 rules)
[info] - J10 never adjudicates: no hadoop source names adjudication, Bedrock, or the AWS SDK
