[info] - a fabricated identifier becomes ABSTAIN after the bounded retry
[info] - malformed JSON is retried once; a valid second reply is used
[info] - the model may abstain, and abstention keeps the pair UNRESOLVED
[info] - prompt injection in a title stays inside the data block and cannot close the delimiter
[info] - cache: hits skip the client and the budget; only schema-valid replies are cached
[info] - cache keys depend on input hash, prompt version, model version, and policy version
[info] - JSONL file cache persists entries across instances
[info] - budget: no call beyond the maximum adjudications or the token budget
[info] - prompt and schema resources load, and the schema's reason codes match the validator
[info] PlannerSpec:
[info] - the rule planner extracts names, windows, and operations of benchmark-style questions
[info] - validation enforces the operation allowlist: scopes, researcher indexes, metrics, topN
[info] - a researcher name or filter term that does not occur in the question is rejected
[info] - window selection: stored windows exact, other ranges widen with a note, no corpus year abstains
[info] - request fields override the model; retrieval limits are clamped to configuration
[info] - output schemas: exact keys, enums equal the Scala enums, only the supported keywords
[info] - the model planner retries once with the failed rule names, then falls back to the rules
[info] - every model attempt passes the throttle, and an attempt over the token budget is not sent
[info] BenchmarkSpec:
[info] - question CSV: quoted commas and escaped quotes parse; bad rows are refused
[info] - stored path reference: the stored researcher sequence and hop lookup in either direction
[info] - fake mode: --max 1 answers one question, a rerun resumes by question ID, and the checks pass
[info] - a stored path that differs from the runtime path fails path-hops and pair-edges
[info] - claim-evidence fails a material claim that cites only semantic context or an unknown ID
[info] - a model that never answers is a call failure (no result is recorded); fake mode is not
[info] - usage: questions and path evidence are required, --max is at least 1, live needs a profile
[info] TemplatesSpec:
[info] - profile text is frozen for rendering-v1
[info] - every document type renders; texts are deterministic and independent of key order
[info] - path statuses, paper, community, and topic wording
[info] - missing required facts fail; missing optional facts drop their sentence
[info] - untrusted text is flattened, capped, and kept as data
[info] WorkflowSpec:
[info] - a dominant name resolves with its share; every material claim cites bundle evidence and verifies
[info] - a shortest path: the PATH and PATH_HOP claims equal the path evidence hop by hop
[info] - an ambiguous name abstains with every candidate and makes no synthesis call
[info] - unsupported requests and missing evidence abstain or are stated, never filled in
[info] - verification statuses: VERIFIED kept, PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED labelled, UNSUPPORTED and CONFLICTING removed
[info] - model synthesis: bad claims are removed, and with no verified claim the answer abstains
[info] - prompt injection in the question, a name, a retrieved document, or a title changes no operation, store call, or claim
[info] - the evidence token budget cuts whole groups, lists the omissions, and cited omitted items fail
[info] - the audit record, QuerySession, and EvidenceBundle items hold the run facts and no question text
