[info] - M3: the live Neptune pre-load check compares SHA-256 hashes with the run manifest
[info] - N6: validator exits 1 when evidence objects are left untraced (no --evidence-root)
[info] - M10: the live table prefix and loader role default to configuration; flags override
[info] LiveRequestSpec:
[info] - S3: write-once put carries If-None-Match and a SHA-256 checksum
[info] - DynamoDB: attribute codec round trip and conditional put requests
[info] - Neptune: loader request and status parsing
[info] - S3 Vectors: put, get, and query requests; filter syntax; response parsing
[info] - Bedrock: Titan V2 invoke request; transient error classification
[info] - refreshing credentials: built lazily, re-resolved per call, rebuilt after refresh
[info] - expired token: refresh and retry once; a second expiry or another 403 is not retried
[info] - guarded refreshes the profile's credentials on an expired token and retries the call
[info] - every live client is built with the profile's refreshing credentials provider
